variable confine_strength equal 0.05        # set strength of qudratic confinement potential for SPH elements belonging to the same electron

### simulation parameters:

variable time_step_length equal 0.25e-3
variable block_time_steps equal 2e2
variable CoM_check_time_steps equal 10
variable dump_freq equal 1
variable cutoff equal 0.4999*${box_len}                                   # cutoff for pairwise calculations
